<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">Mika</book>
  <para style="h">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mika</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mika</para>
  <para style="mt">Mika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda gam leengte Jotham, Ahaz leh Hezekiah vaihawm lai a, Moresheth khomi Mikah kunga Mangpa thu, Samaria leh Jerusalem tungtang a hing tung amu khu tami hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nou mipite aw Ngai un, Aw leitung leh asunga um zousie’n ngaikhie un, Mangpa Pasian, Mangpa ngei khu, Abieh inn siengthou apat noute douna theipitu hiheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai un, Mangpa khu amun apat ahing pawt a, ahing peisuh dinga, leitung mun sangte ahing tuonsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mei kunga khuoilu bang leh a, mun ken a tui sunbuoh bangin, taangte anuoi ah azun ding a, guomte akhipawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tamte zousie Jakob tatkhelnate zieh ngen ahi a, Israel innkuonte khelna zieh ahi. Jakob tatkhelna bang ahiei? Samaria hilou amah? Tualeh Juda mun sangte bang ahiei? Jerusalem hizaw lou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin Samaria gamlah a silsie kisievum bangin, ka bawl ding a, grep huon bawlna mun ka suohsah dinga, asuongte guom ah ka liakhe suh dinga, a suongphumte ka dawhsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A milim khuohthaw zousie uh, akisatguoi sieng ding a, akizua man zousie uh akihaltum ding a, amilim zousie ka suse ding hi. Ki zuana man ding a alahkhawmte, kizuana man ding mamain a kipekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Kap leh mau in ka awi dinga, kisutkhie in guohtangin ka pei dinga, si alte bangin kikou in ka mau dinga, vangawngsaute bangin ka thum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen aliemnate suhdamthei ahisih a, Juda gam tunga atuntaah zieh in, ka mite kotpi Jerusalem ngel ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gath khuo ah gendoh sih unlen, Kap vawt sihun; Beth-Aphrah khuo ah leivui lah ah kilawmlie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nou Saphire khuo a tengte saguoh a, maizum in pei un, Zaanan a tengte apusuoh sih ua. Beth-Ezel in a suun a, adinna mun nang apat a lahmang ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen Maroth khomite’n; tan hoi angah ua, Hinanleh Mangpa akipat sietna, Jerusalem kotpi ah ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nou Lakish khuo a tengte aw, Sakolleng khu sakol hattah ah vaw un. Amanu khu Zion tanu khelna kipatnabul ahi; aziehpen Israel tatkhelna khu nangma ah mudoh a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaziehin Moresheth-Gath kungah, silpieh napieh ding ahi. Akzib innte khu Israel leengte a dingin, zuou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Nou Mareshah a tengte aw, nou a dingin gouluotu khat ka hing pui ding a; Adullam ah Israel thupina ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na ta deitahte ziehun, kiheukieu unlen, na sam uh heukieu un, Noute akipat saltang a puimang ding ahizieh un, na lutang uh langta lu bangin kieu sah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Alupna tung ua thugilou ngaituo a, silgilou sawm mite tung agih hi. Amaute khut a silbawltheina um ahi zieh in zingmawng khovah chieng in tami abawl zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaun mi loute adeigaw ua, thagum in alahpieh ua, innte adeigaw ua, akilah zel uhi Tambangin mi leh a inn, mihing leh a goutan simmawtahin a sugenthei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuazieh in Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai in, tam innkuon tungah sietna tunsah sawm ka hi a, khuna pat na ngawng uh na ladoh sih ding ua, kisathei tahin na pei nawn sih ding uhi; aziehpen tami hun hoilou ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin noute demna in, paunah agendoh ding ua, Kaala lungsiet huoitah sakawm in, “Nasatah a suhsiet ihita! Ama’n ka mite goutan aheng lamdangta a, bangchidan a kei apat a alahmang atai! mihelhatte kungah iloute ahawmzahta achi ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin aisan a gamgi khau te ding, Mangpa mi kikhawmte lah ah, koima na nei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thu gen sihun,” thugenlawh mite kungah na chi uhi. Tuachi’n na kung uah “Thu agen sih ding ua, zumna khu zumna in athuh sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Nou Jakob innkuonte chia kihante, Mangpa Hagau in dawtheina atasam amah? Tamte Ama bawl ahiei mah? Dihtah a umte tungah, ka thu in silhoi abawl sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tumasang zepin ka mite melma bangin, ahing dingdoh uhi; Kidou utlou a, galmuongtah a, nouma hing muongmi vahvielte, akipat in apuonsilte u’leh, apuontuolte uh na hawhkhiet pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mite lah a numeite a inn nuomtahte, ua kipat na notdoh ua, atate ua kipat ka thupina na lamang denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dingdoh unlen peimang un! tami na khawlna ding uh ahisih hi, suhbua ahitaah ziehin manthaina, nasatah in noute ahing suse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi koi ahiei in zuou gen a, “Zu leh zuchia kham thei thu ka gen ding hi” achi leh, tam mite guolnei in apang thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jakob na unpiun ka hing, khawm khawm kia ngei ngei ding hi, Israel umsunte ka puikhawmkia ngeingei dinga, Belam huonga belam khumkhawmte bangin, a ann maina mun ua belamhonte bangin, amaute ka khumkhawm dinga, mihing atam sengseng ziehun, akikouthang zeng zung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amasang uah lampi phuvangpa apei ding a, Amauten kotpi phuvangin apawtkhe ding uhi; Aleengpa uh a mai uah apei ding a, tualeh Mangpa’n amauh ma akai ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ken, Aw! Nou Jakob lamkaite leh, Israel innkuon vaihawm miliente, Ngai un, vaihawmna dih noute thei ding hilou amah? Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nouten silhoi na huo ua, silhoilou na ngaina uhi, Ka mite avun uh na lem pieh ua, agute ua pat atel avou uh na kheu pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mite sa nane ua, amaute apat avunte uh na lipkhie ua, agute uh na sutawng ua, bel sunga sa huon ding bang leh belpi sunga, huon ding sa bangin na atnen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin Mangpa ahan ding ua, Hinanleh Ama’n adawng sih ding hi. Khum hun chiengin, asil bawlte ua atatsiet ziehun, Ama’n amaute apat in Amai aphuolta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangpa’n guolneite tungtangah tambangin agen hi: Ka mite lampielsah a, khat in neh ding apieh chienga “Lemna” thu gen a, Koiman pieh ding aneilou chiengin, ama dou ding in akisa zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin mengmuna mu theilouna, zan hun ahing tung ding a, ai san theilouna hun miel ahing tung ding hi. Guolneite tungah ni atum ding a, amaute ding in suntanglai zong amiel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n mutheite azum ta ding ua, ai san siemte azala ding ua, abawn un pellou in akam uh ahum chiet ding uhi; aziehpen Pasian akipat dawnna a um sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh adihtah in kei pen, Jakob kunga atatkhelna uh phuongzah ding leh, Israelte kunga akhelna uh theisah dingin, Mangpa hagau sibawltheina zieh a, adih a vaihawmna leh thahatna in ka dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nou Jakob innkuon lamkaite leh, Israel innkuon vaihawm liente, adih a vaihawmna huo a, thudih pouma lehei a lumlette aw, tuin tam thu ngaiun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sisan suona toh Zion a lam ua, tualeh Jerusalem thulimlouna toh za un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Alamkaiten nehguhna ziehin thu akhen ua, asiempute’n aman neiin thu ahil ua, guolneiten sum deina in ai asan uhi. Tuachi pumpum in Mangpa tungah akinga ua, “Mangpa eite kungah umlou amah? itung uah sietna atung sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute ziehin Zion khu, loukai bangin akikai dinga, Jerusalem silsie kisevum bang ahi dinga, Biehinn muol khu gamlah gamgaw mun, bang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin tambang ahi dinga: Ni nukhia chiengin, Mangpa inn umna muol khu muolte vum ah suhkip ahi dinga, muolte tung ah tawisang ahi ding a, miten azuon zeng zung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nam tampite ahing pei ding ua, “Hing pei un, Mangpa muol a Jakob Pasian inn ah pei vai, Ama’n alampi ahing na hil dinga, tuachi’n alampite izui ding uhi;” achi ding uhi. Zion apat in dan ahing pawtkhe dinga, Jerusalem apat Mangpa thu ahing pawtdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’n mi tampite kikaal ah vaihawm dinga, gamla tah a nam hattahte zong athuhil dinga, anamsaute uh loukaina siazum in akheng ding ua, tualeh ateipite uh theikungte heuna temkawiin akheng ding uhi. Nam khat in namdangte douna in, anamsau uh aleh nawn sih ding ua, kidou dan zong azil nawnta sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Michin ama uh grepgui nuoi leh atheipi kung, nuoi uah atou hit hiet zawta ding uhi; tualeh koima’n amaute azausah nawn sih ding hi; aziehpen galkapte Mangpa kam in tua thu agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Michin ama pasien min chiet in aumta ding ua, hinanleh eite pen Mangpa i Pasian min in, kumtawn kumtawn in i umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tua ni chiengin, kengbaite ka kaikhawm dinga, Keima’n nawdoh a umte leh, ka suhgentheite ka khawm khawm dinga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aliem abaite asuohta umsun in ka bawl dinga, nawmanga umte nam hattah ka suohsah ding hi; Tuachi’n tu akipat kumtawn dongin, Mangpa’n Zion muol ah, amaute tungah vai ahawmta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Aw Nang belamhonte venna innsang, Zion tanu kulpi muonhuoi, Nangma ah lalna masapen ahing tung ding a, Jerusalem tanu kungah leenggam ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tulaitah a bang ding a nahpitah a kap na hiei? Na lah uah leengpa umlou amah? Nou hing thuhil mite amangthai sieng ata uh amah? Numei nauvei natna bangin ahing manta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu, numei nauvei bangin, nau suohdoh ding bangin gim inlen, nau veiin, gamlah a giehphuol sat dinga, khopi na nuasie hun ahita hi, Babilon gam nangawn ah na pei ding hi. Khunah hutkhieh in na um dinga, khunah Mangpa’n na melmate, khut a kipat in ahing tandoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in zong nam tampite, nangma dou dingin akikhawm uhi; “Ama suhbua in um hen, i mit un Zion etthaw mai vai;” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh amaun Mangpa lunggel atheisih ua, alemguotnate atheisiem sih uhi. Buphuol a buphaite khopkhawm bangin. Ama’n akhawm khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu dingdoh inlen, chiil in, aziehpen na kii khu sia bangin ka bawl dinga, na chinte zong sum-eng in ka bawl ding a, mi tampite na tuonchil ding hi. Tualeh asil met uh Mangpa a dingin, atuom in ka susiengthou ding a, anei alamte uh leitung pumpi, Mangpa kung ah ka tuomkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw galkap honte tanu, eite hing kisimna dingin ikimkot ah panmun khawin ahing imkhumta uhi: na galkap honte khawmin. Amauten Israel vaihawmpa abieng ah chiengin asat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh nang Bethlehem Ephrathah Juda gam a tul tampite lah ah neu mananlechin, nangma a kipat in kei a dingin Israel vaihawmpa ding khat ahing pawt ding hi. Ama kipatchilna tanglai hun, kumtawn kumtawn akipat ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuazieh in nauveinu’n nau apien masangsie in, amanu’n amauh anuasie ding a, Tuachi’n asanggam umsunte Israel tate kungah ahing kinuale kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Ama adingdoh dinga, Mangpa hatna in abelamhonte ava ding a, Mangpa a Pasian min vangletna in ava ding hi; tualeh amauh aumdenta ding uhi. Aziehpen tuin Ama lei tawp donga thupi ding ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh tam mipa khu hamuonna ahi ding hi, Assiriate igam sunga ahing peitah chiengun, tualeh i leeng innpi huongsung ang totchil chiengun, Ama dou dingin belampu sagi leh lamkai lien mi giet itungdoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amauten namsau toh Assiria gam ah vai ahawm ding ua, namsau apai apat dawsa toh Nimrod gam sung avaihawm khum ding uhi. Assiria mite igam dou dinga ahing kuon chieng ua, igamgi sung ahing tot chiengun, Ama’n tambang in Assiriate apat ahing hundoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jakobte lah a ashimawh umsunte mi tampite lah ah Mangpa akipat a daitui bang leh hampa tunga guophin koima ngahselou leh mihing tapate zong ngah selou bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakob shimawh umsunte khu namte lah a mi tampite lah ah, gammang a gamsate lah a humpibahnei bang, leh belamhon lah a humpibahnei bang leh belamhon lah a humpibahnei hatlai bangin, apeina lam lam ah atuonchil a abalnen gawp a, ahunkhe ding koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na melmate tungah na khut dopsang ahi ding a, tualeh na galte zousie sattan in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi. Tua ni chiengin na lah ua na sakolte uh ka sattan dinga, tualeh na sakollengte uh ka suse ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na gamsung ua khopite ka suse dinga, Na kulpidet tahte zousie uh ka suse sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khut ua kipat in na bumsiemnate uh ka sumang ding a, tualeh aisansiem na nei nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na milim khenthute uleh, na milim khuomte uh, na lah ua pat in ka suse ding a, na khutsuohte uh na be nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na lah ua kipat in na Asherimte uh ka botdoh dinga, na khopite uh ka phietmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh ka thu manglou namte tungah lungthahna leh thangpaina phuba lahna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangpa thugen tuin ngai un, Dingdoh unlen, taangte kungah na tungtang thu uh gen unlen, Tualeh muolten na aw za uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw nou taangte Mangpa hing hehna ngaikhie un, Nou leitung kingapna suongphum dettahte aw, Ngai khie un; aziehpen Mangpa’n amite aheh a, tualeh Israel tungthu agen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka mite aw, na tung ua bang ahiei ka bawl? Bangchidan a noute ka hing lungkham sah ahiei? Hing dawng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat in noute ka hing puidoh a, Saltaanna inn apat ka hing tandoh a; na masang uah, Mosi, Aaron leh Miriam ka sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka mite, Moab leengpa Balak in bang agen a, Beor tapa Balaam in bangchin adawng ei, Mangpa dihtatnate na theina ding un, Shittim apat Gilgal dong na khuolzinna uh thei ngitnget un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mangpa maiah bang toh hing pei ding ka hiei, Tungnung Sangpen Pasian mai a bangchi kun ding ka hiei? Bawngnou kum khat a upa toh, Halmang sillat toh, Amai a hing pei ding ka diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa khu belamtal tul tampi leh, sathau luitui tul sawm banga luong tungah alungkim na diei? Ka tatkhelna ziehin ka ta chiil ka pie in, ka hagau khelna ziehin ka tahsa ga pe ding ka hi diei?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw mihing, Aman ahoi ahing ensahta a, Mangpa’n nang akipat ahing phut bang ahiei? Dihtat taha bawl, hepina ngainat, tualeh kingaingiem tah a na Pasian toh, zawhkhawm ahi sih a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa aw khu khopi lam ah akikou a, tualeh pilna nei miin namin athei ding, chieng leh abawlpa, “Ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migiloute innsungah gitlouna goubawm, tualeh tena chinglou kidah huoi a um eimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Buhna dihloute leh lepchietah a ip gihsahte, asiengthou hi, kachi thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mi hausate uh hiemngamna in adim ua, khuna tengte’n zuou agen ua, akamsung ua aleite uh lepchie hattah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin keima’n zong natah a sat in, ka hing chinasah dinga, na khelnate ziehin ka hing suse ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ne ding ua, na gilva tuom sih ding ua, na lah uah gilkielna a um ding a, Na koimang ding a, hinanleh na humbit zou sih dinga, na humbit sun nangawn zong namsau ka pe nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tu dinga, hinanleh na at sih dinga, Olive na chil ding a, hinanleh athau na kinu sih ding, Uoin hum tah na bawl ding a, hinanleh na dawn tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen Omri thugousiete na zui a, Ahab innkuonte tatdan zousie na zui a, athuhilnate bangin na gamta uhi. Tuaziehin ka hing sumang dinga, na sunga tengte chizatin na um ding ua; Tuaziehin ka mite minsietna na khu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka tung gih hina e! Nipi lai a theiga khonkhawm mi leh, grep sang khonkhawm mi bang ka hi bou hi; neh ding aga bomte a um sih a, Ka hinna in alunggul theipi ga min masa lah aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian miginumte leitung apat in amangthaita ua, tualeh mihingte lah ah midihtat khat zong a um nawn sih hi. Amauten sisan suo dingin mi abuh ua, Michin in a unaupa man dingin lenthang toh a sui kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khut langni un silhoilou lawching tahin abawl ua, leengtapa in silpieh angen a, vaihawm mi in neguh ding asui a, milien in lah silhoilou alunggulte agenkhie a, tuabangin apangkhawm chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lah ua mihoipen zong loulingnei bang ahi a, midih pen zong dailingnei sangin ahiemzaw hi. Na galvengte ni leh, nangma hing kigawtna ni ahing tungta hi; Tu khu abuoisietna ni uh ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lawmpa muong sinlen, na lawm na guolte zong muong sin, na angsunga lumnu akipat na kam kotkha vengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen tapa in pa azatat sih a, tanu in anu adou a, mounu in a innpinu adou hi, mihingte melma khu ama innsunga mite mama ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuazieh in kenvang Mangpa lam ka en dinga, ka hundamna Pasian ka ngah ding a, ka Pasian in ahing ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka melma, ka tungah kipah in Thangpai seng sin, ka pua chiengin ka thoukia dinga, miel lah a katou chiengin, Mangpa khu Kei a dingin vah ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keilam a panga ka tungthu ahing gen pieh a, kei a dinga vaihawmna dihtah atangtun masangsie in, atunga ka khelna ziehin, Mangpa thangpaina thuoh ding mawng ka hi. Ama’n vah ah ahing puidoh dinga, Adihtatna ka mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuahun chiengin ka melma in tuakhu amu dinga, “Ka kunga Mangpa na Pasian hei a um ahiei?” Chi nu zumnain atuomkhum, Ka mitten amu ding hi. Tuin amanu kholai a buonnawi bangin, totchil in a umta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua niin na kulbaangte bawl ahi ding a, Tua niin thutanna gamlapi a suonmang ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Assiria akipat kulpi nei khopite akipat in, kulpi akipat Euphrates luipi tandong, tuipi akipat tuipi tandong, muol akipat muol tan dongin na kungah, ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuchi pumpum in zong gam khu, asunga tengte zieh leh asilbawlte uh ga ziehin, suhsiet in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Karmel muol lah a gamnuoi a, lungheltah a um na goutan lah a na belamhon, na mite na khetbuh zangin ching inlen, nidanglai bangin Bashan leh, Gilead gam sungah vah in um chiet u’heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Izipt gam akipat a na hing pawtdoh lai bangun, amaute kungah sil lamdang tahtahte ka ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Namte’n tua khu amu ding ua, asilbawltheina zousie uh azumpi ding uhi; akam uh ahum ding ua, abilte uh abing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gul bangin leivui alieh ding ua, leitunga bohvah ganhingte bangin, akuo ua pat in chitun kawmkawm in ahing pawtdoh ding ua, amauten Mangpa i Pasian uh agiing ding ua, noute ziehin azau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang banga thulimlounate ngaidam a, agoutan umsunte tatkhelna peikan Pasian koi ahiei um? Hepina akipahpi ziehin alungthahna kumtawn in avomden sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Akiheikia dinga itung uah lainatna anei ding a, ithulimlounate uh a nuoi ah akoi ding a, Nang ka khelnate zousie uh tuipi thuhtah sungah na pai lut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nidanglai a kapu leh pate uh na kichiemna bangin, nang Jakob kungah thutah, tualeh Abraham kungah khotuona na pe ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
